      <chord name="Ab"/>Hail, Christ the <chord name="Cm"/>Lord! <chord name="Bbm"/>Your <chord name="Ab"/>people <chord name="Eb"/>pray:<br/>
      <chord name="Cm"/>Come <chord name="Fm"/>quickly, King of <chord name="Gdim"/>kings.
